## Update January 2026: The Cafe is Now the Tour

We ended up retiring the standalone cafe in favor of the [Tour](/tour), an interactive, guided walkthrough of the language. The core idea is the same: live editors, in-browser compilation, instant output. But instead of
dropping you into a blank editor and wishing you luck, the tour walks you through Caffeine step by step across a host of lessons, from basics to a complete example.

This was the natural next step. As mentioned above, Caffeine is pretty niche and _"likely calls for some sort of interactive tour-like tutorial."_ Well, we built it! The compilation pipeline, the debounced auto-compile,
the CodeMirror editors all carries over. We just wrapped it in a proper learning experience.

***